# Viva Questions + Answers

## Practical: Create Simple Mobile Website using jQuery Mobile

---

# 1. Basic Viva Questions

### Q1. What is jQuery Mobile?

jQuery Mobile is a touch-optimized web framework used to create responsive mobile websites and applications using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

---

### Q2. Why do we use jQuery Mobile?

* To create mobile-friendly websites
* To support multiple devices
* To provide responsive UI components
* Faster mobile development

---

### Q3. What technologies are required for jQuery Mobile?

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript
* jQuery library
* jQuery Mobile library

---

### Q4. What is a responsive website?

A responsive website automatically adjusts its layout according to screen size and device.

---

### Q5. What are the advantages of jQuery Mobile?

* Easy to use
* Responsive design
* Cross-platform support
* Touch-friendly UI
* Less coding

---

### Q6. What is CDN?

CDN (Content Delivery Network) provides online hosted libraries like jQuery and Bootstrap.

---

### Q7. Why do we include jQuery before jQuery Mobile?

Because jQuery Mobile depends on jQuery library.

---

### Q8. What is the purpose of viewport meta tag?

It makes the website responsive on mobile devices.

Example:

```html
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
```

---

# 2. Structure-Based Questions

### Q9. What is `data-role="page"`?

It defines a page container in jQuery Mobile.

Example:

```html
<div data-role="page">
```

---

### Q10. What is `data-role="header"`?

Creates header section.

---

### Q11. What is `data-role="content"`?

Defines main content area.

---

### Q12. What is `data-role="footer"`?

Creates footer section.

---

### Q13. What is `data-role="button"`?

Creates mobile-styled button.

---

### Q14. What is `data-role="navbar"`?

Used to create navigation menu.

---

### Q15. What is `data-role="listview"`?

Creates mobile-styled lists.

---

# 3. Coding Questions

### Q16. Write basic structure of jQuery Mobile page.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Mobile Website</title>

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

<link rel="stylesheet"
href="https://code.jquery.com/mobile/1.4.5/jquery.mobile-1.4.5.min.css">

<script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-1.11.1.min.js"></script>

<script src="https://code.jquery.com/mobile/1.4.5/jquery.mobile-1.4.5.min.js"></script>

</head>

<body>

<div data-role="page">

<div data-role="header">
<h1>My Website</h1>
</div>

<div role="main" class="ui-content">
<p>Hello World</p>
</div>

<div data-role="footer">
<h4>Footer</h4>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
```

---

### Q17. How to create a button?

```html
<a href="#" data-role="button">Click Me</a>
```

---

### Q18. How to create a listview?

```html
<ul data-role="listview">
<li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="#">About</a></li>
</ul>
```

---

### Q19. How to create multiple pages in one HTML file?

```html
<div data-role="page" id="home">
</div>

<div data-role="page" id="about">
</div>
```

---

### Q20. How to navigate between pages?

```html
<a href="#about">Go to About Page</a>
```

---

# 4. Theory Questions

### Q21. Difference between jQuery and jQuery Mobile?

| jQuery                    | jQuery Mobile       |
| ------------------------- | ------------------- |
| JavaScript library        | Mobile UI framework |
| Used for DOM manipulation | Used for mobile UI  |
| General purpose           | Mobile-specific     |

---

### Q22. What is touch optimization?

UI designed specially for finger touch interaction.

---

### Q23. What is AJAX navigation in jQuery Mobile?

Pages load dynamically without full refresh.

---

### Q24. What is theme in jQuery Mobile?

Themes change colors and appearance of UI components.

---

### Q25. What is mobile-first design?

Designing website for mobile devices first, then desktop.

---

