# 6. Advanced Viva Questions

### Q31. What is single-page template in jQuery Mobile?

Multiple pages stored in one HTML file.

---

### Q32. What is transition effect?

Animation between page changes.

Example:

```html
<a href="#page2" data-transition="slide">
```

---

### Q33. Types of transitions?

* slide
* fade
* pop
* flip

---

### Q34. How to create collapsible content?

```html
<div data-role="collapsible">
<h3>Click Me</h3>
<p>Hidden Content</p>
</div>
```

---

### Q35. How to create form in jQuery Mobile?

```html
<form>
<label>Name:</label>
<input type="text">

<label>Password:</label>
<input type="password">
</form>
```

